sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser User
  participant UI as Shell UI
  participant SC as ShellConsumer
  participant CA as User SSH CA
  participant H as Target sshd

  U->>UI: Open /servers/{id}/shell
  UI->>SC: Open WebSocket /ws/servers/{id}/shell
  SC->>SC: Authenticate session + object permission check

  SC->>SC: Generate ephemeral keypair (tmp dir)
  SC->>CA: Sign ephemeral public key (short TTL)
  CA-->>SC: SSH certificate

  SC->>H: Start ssh -tt with key + cert
  U<->>SC: Terminal I/O over WebSocket
  SC<->>H: SSH stream

  U->>SC: Disconnect/close tab
  SC->>SC: Terminate process and clean temp key material

  Note over U,H: Feature is beta; session transcript retention is limited
